STEP 4: THE GAP-CONTRACTION MONOTONICITY TEST for meas(S7) (the dovetail mechanism).
  HYP-2608 found contraction is NON-monotone for EWLB/S_1.  Is meas(S7) ITSELF monotone
  under pulling the top block in?  If YES (for gaps>=some bound), every E contracts to a
  bounded-span shape WITHOUT decreasing meas(S7), so the box max = global max RIGOROUSLY.
  We test the SINGLE-GAP contraction C_i: if gap g_i=e_{i+1}-e_i >= 2, lower e_{i+1..k}
  by 1.  Monotone-up means meas(S7(contracted)) >= meas(S7(E)).
================================================================================================
